## simulation/.runtime/ — track research data, ignore volatile state.
##
## TRACKED (research artifacts, written once per auction/episode):
##   save_slots.json                          — folder + slot catalog (needed for UI to load anything)
##   save_slots/save_slot_*/runtime_meta.json — slot metadata (mode, phase, done flag)
##   save_slots/save_slot_*/auction_exports/  — bid logs, csv, xlsx, metadata.json
##   save_slots/save_slot_*/deception_episode/ — episode_log.json + metadata.json
##   save_slots/save_slot_*/auction_usage.jsonl — token usage logs (research data)
##
## IGNORED (volatile, churn on every UI action — would dirty git constantly):
##   save_slots/save_slot_*/runtime.pkl       — Python pickle, rewrites on each step
##   save_slots/save_slot_*/step_worker.log   — verbose LLM debug output
##   save_slots/save_slot_*/step_payload.json — last request payload
##   mega_batch/                              — negotiation batch scratch space
simulation/.runtime/save_slots/*/runtime.pkl
simulation/.runtime/save_slots/*/step_worker.log
simulation/.runtime/save_slots/*/step_payload.json
simulation/.runtime/mega_batch/
simulation/training_logs/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
